	"data": "Module 7: Health & Monitoring — Implementation Detail\n\nPart of the Custom RAG Pipeline. See custom-rag-pipeline.md for the full system map.\n\nOverview\n\nM7 answers the question: \"Is the pipeline healthy, and is it working well?\" It provides:\nPipeline health checks — are Qdrant, Ollama, and SQLite alive and consistent?\nOperational metrics — how many points, how fast are searches, cache hit rates?\nAlerting — surface problems before they become failures (stale index, Qdrant down, embed cache…",
